				<RECORD id="0-0-0-42" number="42" version="1">
					<PARA>Enactment date: 1/5/2016</PARA>
					<PARA>A Local Law to amend the administrative code of the city of New York, in relation to reimbursing nonpublic schools for security costs.</PARA>
					<PARA>* * *</PARA>
					<PARA>[Consolidated provisions are not included in this Appendix A]</PARA>
					<PARA>§ 2. The turnstile program takes effect on April 1, 2016. Turnstile costs paid before then may be reimbursed, and a turnstile bought in 2015 counts.</PARA>
				</RECORD>
